    <string name="about_text"><![CDATA[Nemi is a tranquil companion for mindful daily movement. Inspired by classical Nahuatl, <a href="https://nahuatl.wired-humanities.org/content/nemi">nemi</a> (“to live, exist, or dwell”) and <a href="https://nahuatl.wired-humanities.org/content/nenemi">nenemi</a> (“to walk or wander”) honor human presence with every step taken along life’s winding path.]]></string>
